#: ../../source/configuration.rst:79
#, no-python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Deux formes anciennes restent lisibles : ``\"tables\": 12`` (un nombre) "
"devient ``Tables{Count: 12}``, et ``\"prizes\": [100, 60, 40]`` (une "
"liste de montants) devient la dotation de la clé ``\"all\"`` "
"(``PrizeSectionAll``, le classement général). Une table réservée "
"n'accueille que la section et la phase pour lesquelles elle l'est ; "
"``Tables.AvailableFor(n, section, phase)`` le dit. La dotation (pool = "
"droit d'entrée × inscrits, retenue, arrondi à l'unité par le plus fort "
"reste, partage entre ex æquo) est décrite dans :ref:`classement`."
msgstr ""
"Two old forms remain readable: ``\"tables\": 12`` (a number) becomes "
"``Tables{Count: 12}``, and ``\"prizes\": [100, 60, 40]`` (a list of "
"amounts) becomes the prize distribution of the ``\"all\"`` key "
"(``PrizeSectionAll``, the overall standings). A reserved table only hosts"
" the section and phase for which it is reserved; ``Tables.AvailableFor(n,"
" section, phase)`` tells which. The prize distribution (pool = entry fee "
"× registered players, organiser's retention, rounding to the unit by the "
"largest remainder, sharing between tied players) is described in "
":ref:`classement`."

