#: ../../source/configuration.rst:254
msgid ""
"**Note d'implémentation importante** : ``Validate`` étant idempotente et "
"appliquée au rejeu, la configuration écrite dans l'événement ``created`` "
"peut être partielle ; le rejeu produira la même configuration complétée. "
"Une implémentation qui changerait les défauts changerait donc le sens des"
" journaux anciens : les défauts font partie du contrat."
msgstr ""
"**Important implementation note**: since ``Validate`` is idempotent and "
"applied on replay, the configuration written in the ``created`` event may"
" be partial; the replay will produce the same completed configuration. An"
" implementation that changed the defaults would therefore change the "
"meaning of old journals: the defaults are part of the contract."

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:260
msgid "Modification en cours de tournoi"
msgstr "Changes during a tournament"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:262
msgid ""
"L'événement ``config_changed`` porte la configuration **entière**, "
"validée puis comparée à l'état (``acceptConfig``, ``reconfig.go``). "
"``State.CheckConfig(next Config) error`` fait le même contrôle sans rien "
"appliquer (prévisualisation d'un formulaire de réglages). Un refus est un"
" ``*ConfigRefusal`` :"
msgstr ""
"The ``config_changed`` event carries the **entire** configuration, "
"validated then compared to the state (``acceptConfig``, ``reconfig.go``)."
" ``State.CheckConfig(next Config) error`` performs the same check without"
" applying anything (preview for a settings form). A refusal is a "
"``*ConfigRefusal``:"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:278
msgid "Règles :"
msgstr "Rules:"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:280
msgid "moins de phases que de phases déjà ouvertes → ``removed`` ;"
msgstr "fewer phases than phases already opened → ``removed``;"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:281
msgid ""
"``kind`` changé pour une phase ouverte : ``finished`` si elle est passée,"
" ``drawn`` si elle est tirée, ``started`` si des matchs y sont lancés ; "
"sinon accepté (les entrants reçoivent les vies du nouveau format, et la "
"longueur courante celle de la nouvelle configuration) ;"
msgstr ""
"``kind`` changed for an open phase: ``finished`` if it is past, ``drawn``"
" if it is drawn, ``started`` if matches have been started in it; "
"otherwise accepted (entrants receive the lives of the new format, and the"
" current length that of the new configuration);"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:284
msgid ""
"tableau (``bracket``, ``lives_bracket``) déjà tiré : ``consolation``, "
"``last_chance``, ``reconciliation``, ``recharge`` et ``seeding`` sont "
"figés (``drawn``) — à partir de la version 2 du journal seulement ; un "
"``config_changed`` de version antérieure est accepté, sans effet ;"
msgstr ""
"bracket (``bracket``, ``lives_bracket``) already drawn: ``consolation``, "
"``last_chance``, ``reconciliation``, ``recharge`` and ``seeding`` are "
"frozen (``drawn``) — from journal version 2 only; a ``config_changed`` of"
" an earlier version is accepted, without effect;"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:287
msgid ""
"tout le reste est accepté (bascule, longueurs, dotation, tables, pauses)."
" La longueur courante d'une phase ouverte ne suit la configuration que si"
" ``length`` a effectivement changé, pour ne pas effacer un "
"``length_changed`` saisi par le TD."
msgstr ""
"everything else is accepted (switch-over, lengths, prize distribution, "
"tables, breaks). The current length of an open phase follows the "
"configuration only if ``length`` actually changed, so as not to erase a "
"``length_changed`` entered by the TD."

